WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:08.463
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:08.733 --> 01:12.573
[3. One and Only Summer]

3
01:14.096 --> 01:15.371
- Goh Hui Jun. - Here!

4
01:15.371 --> 01:16.721
[Episode 3] [To-do list]

5
01:16.721 --> 01:17.979
- Kim Gi Nam. - Yes.

6
01:17.979 --> 01:18.975
[Collect purses, Christmas in Switzerland, higher SAT score]

7
01:18.975 --> 01:20.507
- Kim Jin Mi. - Here.

8
01:20.507 --> 01:21.311
[Sung Sae Ryeong]

9
01:21.311 --> 01:22.964
- Kim Hye Won. - Here.

10
01:22.964 --> 01:24.283
Sung...

11
01:30.445 --> 01:32.519
- Oh Yun Beom. - Here.

12
01:34.116 --> 01:36.398
- Yu Jin Yeong. - Here.

13
01:37.077 --> 01:39.079
Lee Na Gyeong.

14
01:39.079 --> 01:40.773
Here.

15
01:40.773 --> 01:42.541
Lee Won Bae.

16
01:42.541 --> 01:43.816
Here.

17
01:44.948 --> 01:47.401
- Lee Hyeon Jin. - Yes, sir.

18
01:48.380 --> 01:51.110
- Lee Il Ho. - Present.

19
01:52.551 --> 01:55.080
Sung Sae Ryeong's absent today, right?

20
01:55.080 --> 01:56.989
Why didn't he call on her?

21
01:57.696 --> 02:00.731
He just skipped right over her, right?

22
02:01.583 --> 02:04.346
Hey, Jin Mi. Have you heard from Sung Sae Ryeong at all?

23
02:05.564 --> 02:06.645
No.

24
02:06.645 --> 02:08.020
Nothing.

25
02:08.656 --> 02:09.919
Listen to this.

26
02:09.919 --> 02:14.103
This morning, I overheard my parents say something strange.

27
02:14.103 --> 02:15.236
What strange thing?

28
02:15.236 --> 02:16.279
Come on, what is it?

29
02:16.279 --> 02:18.994
Tell us, tell us! Come on, spit it out!

30
02:18.994 --> 02:21.235
- What? - Well, it was...

31
02:23.136 --> 02:25.292
I heard that Sung Sae Ryeong died.

32
02:25.292 --> 02:27.763
Hey! That's nothing to joke about!

33
02:27.763 --> 02:29.337
You shouldn't lie about that stuff.

34
02:29.337 --> 02:31.929
I'm not joking, I swear!

35
02:31.929 --> 02:34.505
- Did you hear about Sung Sae Ryeong? - Hear what?

36
02:35.927 --> 02:38.307
- Stop lying. - I'm serious!

37
02:38.307 --> 02:40.348
What? Who died?

38
02:40.348 --> 02:42.273
She said Sung Sae Ryeong died.

39
02:42.273 --> 02:43.316
- No way. - What?

40
02:43.316 --> 02:45.379
- Are you for real? - Yeah, I am.

41
04:27.916 --> 04:29.486
Hi, Yun Ah.

42
04:31.189 --> 04:32.596
It's me, Ha Yeon.

43
04:33.336 --> 04:34.756
Hi, Ha Yeon!

44
04:38.758 --> 04:40.674
What number are you calling from?

45
04:42.637 --> 04:44.199
Well, see...

46
04:44.931 --> 04:48.360
I called because I don't think I can give you that 50,000 won.

47
04:49.979 --> 04:50.979
You know,

48
04:50.979 --> 04:54.478
the money that you ordered Heo Mi Hee to get from me.

49
04:56.109 --> 04:58.403
I can't give it to you.

50
04:58.403 --> 05:00.614
W-What did you say?

51
05:00.614 --> 05:01.990
I'm sorry.

52
05:01.990 --> 05:05.013
Something came up, and I need it.

53
05:05.013 --> 05:06.745
Hey, Ha Yeon.

54
05:06.745 --> 05:08.722
I'm Yun Ah.

55
05:08.722 --> 05:10.373
- Choi Yun Ah. - Yun Ah!

56
05:10.373 --> 05:11.575
Let's go to the restroom together.

57
05:11.575 --> 05:13.376
Come on!

58
05:13.376 --> 05:14.961
I know.

59
05:14.961 --> 05:17.152
You're Choi Yun Ah.

60
05:17.152 --> 05:21.321
And I know you've been using Heo Mi Hee to bully me,

61
05:21.968 --> 05:27.807
and I know you've been pretending to be nice to me all this time.

62
05:27.807 --> 05:30.622
I don't see what you're getting at, Ha Yeon.

63
05:30.622 --> 05:32.866
Is there something going on with you?

64
05:35.857 --> 05:37.058
Yes.

65
05:38.234 --> 05:40.641
I'm dying today.

66
05:40.641 --> 05:41.917
What?

67
05:42.822 --> 05:45.706
I just thought I'd call before I die.

68
05:46.618 --> 05:51.331
I figured you had no idea I knew who you really are.

69
05:51.331 --> 05:53.958
It started with the sundress.

70
05:53.958 --> 05:56.038
Why would Heo Mi Hee even want it?

71
05:56.038 --> 05:57.837
As you know,

72
05:57.837 --> 06:02.147
she has a burn scar on her leg that she's insecure about, and keeps under long socks.

73
06:02.147 --> 06:06.411
I've never even seen her wear shorts outside of school, much less a skirt.

74
06:07.764 --> 06:09.404
So why the sundress?

75
06:10.726 --> 06:12.404
Ugh...

76
06:15.105 --> 06:16.702
But, Choi Yun Ah...

77
06:18.108 --> 06:19.528
I...

78
06:20.777 --> 06:22.816
I still liked you.

79
06:23.822 --> 06:28.121
I knew you were a cheat, and I still liked you regardless.

80
06:29.369 --> 06:30.412
Why?

81
06:33.415 --> 06:36.605
Because you'd at least pretend to be nice to me.

82
06:39.504 --> 06:41.044
Pretending to be kind.

83
06:43.007 --> 06:44.657
Pretending that you don't hate me.

84
06:44.657 --> 06:45.733
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon.

85
06:45.733 --> 06:48.834
But since I'm dying anyway, let me give you some advice.

86
06:51.141 --> 06:53.755
Don't ever make anyone go through this again.

87
06:56.896 --> 07:00.305
Speaking from experience, indirect bullying is worse than active bullying.

88
07:03.134 --> 07:04.977
It sucks beyond words.

89
07:07.589 --> 07:08.947
Wouldn't you agree?

90
07:10.118 --> 07:13.315
You're not just a horrible person, but a spineless coward as well.

91
07:15.043 --> 07:16.618
So, Choi Yun Ah,

92
07:17.459 --> 07:19.888
you are, no doubt...

93
07:20.712 --> 07:22.478
the worst person I know of.

94
07:22.478 --> 07:24.174
I'm telling you in good faith,

95
07:24.174 --> 07:27.407
because I was worried you'd never learn how horrible you are your whole life.

96
07:31.014 --> 07:33.845
The biggest tramp in this whole wide world,

97
07:35.268 --> 07:37.226
is no other than you.

98
07:37.226 --> 07:38.382
Hey!

99
07:54.871 --> 07:57.375
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon!

100
08:39.207 --> 08:41.209
Hey, Babe.

101
08:41.209 --> 08:42.583
Yeah?

102
08:42.583 --> 08:43.878
Ha Yeon...

103
08:43.878 --> 08:45.213
She...

104
08:45.213 --> 08:50.023
Did she not come home, or did she leave early?

105
08:50.760 --> 08:54.641
Her uniform and book bag are still here, but her shoes are gone.

106
08:55.955 --> 08:58.018
She must've gone out.

107
08:58.018 --> 08:59.511
I need to go.

108
09:01.229 --> 09:03.292
But...

109
09:03.292 --> 09:06.757
I think... she's gone missing.

110
09:08.020 --> 09:09.279
Don't you think?

111
09:09.279 --> 09:11.823
What? There's no way.

112
09:12.476 --> 09:13.862
Call her.

113
09:21.416 --> 09:25.732
The number you are calling is temporarily unavailable.

114
09:27.192 --> 09:30.764
Did you see the text Mom sent you yesterday?

115
09:31.509 --> 09:32.822
No.

116
09:32.822 --> 09:34.257
Why not?

117
09:35.471 --> 09:37.849
My phone fell in the sea.

118
09:40.476 --> 09:41.743
Seriously...

119
09:47.358 --> 09:49.196
Who is it?

120
09:53.698 --> 09:55.554
Excuse me, ma'am.

121
09:56.451 --> 09:57.953
Good morning.

122
09:57.953 --> 09:59.968
I'm from the Upo District Women and Juvenile Affairs Division,

123
09:59.968 --> 10:02.821
Youth Affairs Team 2, Police Sergeant Choi Wan Jae.

124
10:04.334 --> 10:07.591
You must be Kim Ha Yeon's caretaker.

125
10:09.130 --> 10:11.079
Yes, I am, sir.

126
10:11.079 --> 10:12.422
What's this about?

127
10:13.433 --> 10:15.195
Is she home right now?

128
10:40.328 --> 10:44.874
200 meters in one minute and fifty seconds!

129
10:44.874 --> 10:47.377
That's a new record.

130
10:47.377 --> 10:48.407
Hey, Yu Gyeom.

131
10:48.407 --> 10:51.690
You'd easily win the national tournament with a record like this.

132
10:57.679 --> 10:58.716
Hey.

133
11:01.849 --> 11:06.229
Are you serious about just keeping this as a hobby?

134
11:06.229 --> 11:07.514
Yeah, it can't be helped.

135
11:07.514 --> 11:09.671
Or do you have any other ideas?

136
11:10.274 --> 11:12.594
Don't tell this to your grandfather.

137
11:12.594 --> 11:14.017
Come here, boy.

138
11:14.654 --> 11:15.850
Come on.

139
11:19.909 --> 11:22.883
You should persuade him yourself.

140
11:23.625 --> 11:27.317
I failed, but I really do think you'll manage!

141
11:29.752 --> 11:30.837
Come on!

142
11:30.837 --> 11:33.172
Just try it once, please?

143
11:33.172 --> 11:35.274
I'm not asking you to try it twice, just bring it up once!

144
11:35.274 --> 11:36.357
Just this once!

145
11:36.357 --> 11:38.262
My father tried that, too.

146
11:38.262 --> 11:40.785
"Just this once," and "Just one more time."

147
11:41.723 --> 11:45.712
He made it into the national team, and into the Olympics,

148
11:45.712 --> 11:48.106
and became the first person from Asia to make it into the finals.

149
11:49.022 --> 11:50.413
Hey, Teach.

150
11:50.413 --> 11:53.096
Do you know what happened to him after that?

151
11:55.445 --> 11:57.330
He forfeited.

152
11:57.330 --> 11:59.596
He forfeited after making it to the finals.

153
12:00.491 --> 12:05.347
I wasn't born yet, so I didn't know, but I heard it was a whole thing.

154
12:06.109 --> 12:09.684
He became the punching bag of the whole country.

155
12:11.085 --> 12:12.670
So, sir.

156
12:12.670 --> 12:14.255
I'd rather not.

157
12:14.255 --> 12:17.242
I don't want to compete if I'm going to end up like my dad.

158
12:17.242 --> 12:19.635
Nobody wants to be the national punching bag.

159
12:19.635 --> 12:22.702
Then you'll just have to see it to the end, unlike him.

160
12:23.848 --> 12:24.928
Just this once.

161
12:24.928 --> 12:27.080
Cho Yu Gyeom!

162
12:31.856 --> 12:37.469
We just want to know what you were doing between 8 p.m. and midnight yesterday.

163
12:38.905 --> 12:41.324
I was at the lighthouse.

164
12:41.324 --> 12:43.226
The lighthouse?

165
12:43.226 --> 12:44.952
The lighthouse by the Upo Country Club.

166
12:44.952 --> 12:46.829
Who were you with?

167
12:46.829 --> 12:47.927
I was alone.

168
12:47.927 --> 12:52.043
Did you meet Sung Sae Ryeong by any chance?

169
12:52.043 --> 12:53.075
No, I didn't.

170
12:53.075 --> 12:54.729
What about Kim Ha Yeon?

171
12:56.172 --> 12:57.388
No.

172
12:57.388 --> 12:59.584
Then why were you there?

173
12:59.584 --> 13:00.770
At night, no less?

174
13:02.499 --> 13:04.071
I was waiting for someone.

175
13:04.071 --> 13:05.140
Who?

176
13:05.140 --> 13:07.661
- Was it Sung Sae Ryeong? - No, Kim Ha Yeon.

177
13:08.434 --> 13:11.965
By the way, I don't see why you're asking me all this.

178
13:11.965 --> 13:13.981
What's wrong with Ha Yeon?

179
13:13.981 --> 13:17.931
She has been missing since last night.

180
13:18.736 --> 13:19.974
Ha Yeon's missing?

181
13:19.974 --> 13:23.074
Why? Did something bad happen to her?

182
13:23.074 --> 13:24.225
No, no.

183
13:24.225 --> 13:27.115
We're still trying to figure out what happened.

184
13:27.787 --> 13:29.747
But this is peculiar.

185
13:29.747 --> 13:32.593
Are you more interested in Kim Ha Yeon?

186
13:32.593 --> 13:37.923
I heard Sung Sae Ryeong was your girlfriend, but you seem disinterested in her whereabouts.

187
13:43.010 --> 13:44.289
Did Sae Ryeong...

188
13:45.304 --> 13:47.182
die, or something?

189
14:03.865 --> 14:07.303
Ma'am, I don't speak sign language.

190
14:07.303 --> 14:08.646
My granddaughter.

191
14:08.646 --> 14:11.825
- I'm sorry, I don't know sign language! - My granddaughter!

192
14:17.533 --> 14:19.509
Sung Sae Ryeong is...

193
14:23.301 --> 14:26.069
Your granddaughter is awake now.

194
14:26.069 --> 14:28.093
You must've been so worried, ma'am.

195
14:36.647 --> 14:38.056
alive.

196
14:39.901 --> 14:42.737
She injured her head pretty badly, though.

197
14:42.737 --> 14:44.336
All's well if she's alive.

198
14:44.336 --> 14:46.052
Well, the problem is...

199
14:59.086 --> 15:01.486
Yes, this is 112, emergency services.

200
15:04.467 --> 15:05.672
How did you get hurt?

201
15:05.672 --> 15:07.485
Can you speak, miss?

202
15:09.263 --> 15:10.729
Cho Yu Gyeom...

203
15:11.557 --> 15:12.563
Yes, miss?

204
15:14.769 --> 15:16.368
Cho Yu Gyeom.

205
15:17.021 --> 15:18.827
Sung Sae Ryeong

206
15:18.827 --> 15:22.057
said that you, Cho Yu Gyeom, hit her and caused her injury,

207
15:22.057 --> 15:24.403
and directly informed the police about it.

208
15:24.403 --> 15:26.719
That's why we're here.

209
15:26.719 --> 15:28.014
That lunatic.

210
15:28.669 --> 15:29.726
What?

211
15:31.535 --> 15:32.707
Listen here.

212
15:34.205 --> 15:36.802
Sung Sae Ryeong is a complete lunatic.

213
15:36.802 --> 15:38.241
Did you know that?

214
15:40.419 --> 15:43.130
We still have to investigate it.

215
15:43.130 --> 15:47.584
She's not in a condition to give us any straight answers as of now.

216
15:47.584 --> 15:52.297
We'd like you to accompany us to the precinct.

217
15:52.297 --> 15:55.330
Come with us to the station, please.

218
16:03.484 --> 16:04.756
Is that you, Jung Yeon?

219
16:04.756 --> 16:05.831
Jung Yeon!

220
16:05.831 --> 16:07.362
Have you seen Ha Yeon?

221
16:08.197 --> 16:09.616
No.

222
16:10.700 --> 16:11.947
I haven't.

223
16:11.947 --> 16:13.912
She's gone missing!

224
16:13.912 --> 16:16.188
That unhinged brat apparently beat up some local girl!

225
16:16.188 --> 16:17.989
And she did it with some boy!

226
16:17.989 --> 16:20.667
She's seriously driving me crazy!

227
16:20.667 --> 16:22.642
That unruly brat of a girl!

228
16:25.047 --> 16:26.272
Mom.

229
16:26.272 --> 16:27.495
What?

230
16:27.495 --> 16:29.343
What now?

231
16:29.343 --> 16:33.833
I think she came by our home in Seoul.

232
16:33.833 --> 16:35.016
What?

233
16:35.016 --> 16:36.161
When?

234
16:37.059 --> 16:38.603
Well...

235
16:57.038 --> 17:00.390
I think I heard someone come in while I was taking a nap.

236
17:01.250 --> 17:03.833
I think that was her going into her room.

237
17:03.833 --> 17:05.176
You.

238
17:05.176 --> 17:07.135
Do you really have no idea where she went?

239
17:07.135 --> 17:09.205
- She... - I honestly don't know.

240
17:12.011 --> 17:13.846
Hello?

241
17:13.846 --> 17:15.934
Hello? Jung Yeon!

242
17:20.144 --> 17:21.729
Mom, Dad.

243
17:21.729 --> 17:24.190
Thank you for raising me.

244
17:24.190 --> 17:26.013
I wish you a happy life as well, Jung Yeon.

245
17:26.013 --> 17:30.223
I heard people tell their family that they love them before they die.

246
17:30.223 --> 17:34.185
But I don't recall receiving any love, so I have none to give back.

247
17:35.247 --> 17:37.924
However, I truly do feel sorry for Sung Sae Ryeong.

248
17:38.746 --> 17:40.451
Tell her...

249
17:41.374 --> 17:43.683
that I said I'm sorry.

250
17:46.507 --> 17:47.609
Mom.

251
17:49.048 --> 17:53.901
I think... she wrote us a goodbye letter.

252
17:53.901 --> 17:58.369
She wrote that she wants us to tell Sung Sae Ryeong she's sorry.

253
17:59.698 --> 18:00.856
What?

254
18:00.856 --> 18:02.492
What are you saying?

255
18:03.187 --> 18:04.528
Oh my goodness!

256
18:04.528 --> 18:05.953
No way, did she really?

257
18:05.953 --> 18:08.172
Did she actually assault that Sung Sae Ryeong girl?

258
18:09.634 --> 18:11.597
The police came by this morning!

259
18:11.597 --> 18:13.980
Some girl named Sae Ryeong reported her.

260
18:13.980 --> 18:16.229
She said Ha Yeon hit her!

261
18:16.229 --> 18:18.035
And that boy, the boy!

262
18:18.035 --> 18:21.721
The boy who did it with her is already at the police station now!

263
18:21.721 --> 18:23.242
Unbelievable.

264
18:23.242 --> 18:24.358
Think about that.

265
18:24.358 --> 18:26.616
Ha Yeon isn't the type to hit anyone.

266
18:26.616 --> 18:27.944
It makes no sense!

267
18:27.944 --> 18:30.814
She's more the type to get beaten up.

268
18:30.814 --> 18:33.087
She'd never hit anyone!

269
18:33.926 --> 18:35.757
Jung Yeon...

270
18:35.757 --> 18:38.296
If this actually turns into a case, there'll be a School Violence Committee trial!

271
18:38.296 --> 18:40.891
They'll put it in her official school report!

272
18:40.891 --> 18:43.727
She's already struggling to make it into a university in Seoul!

273
18:43.727 --> 18:45.731
Everything's a disaster!

274
18:46.397 --> 18:48.164
I should teach her a lesson!

275
18:48.164 --> 18:49.759
How dare she disappear after doing something so stupid?

276
18:49.759 --> 18:51.634
Where the hell is she?

277
18:53.237 --> 18:54.359
Mom.

278
18:54.359 --> 18:55.704
What now?

279
18:55.704 --> 18:57.001
What!

280
18:59.493 --> 19:01.504
She said she's going to die.

281
19:02.413 --> 19:03.429
What?

282
19:04.457 --> 19:07.587
Whether she hit someone or not isn't the point!

283
19:08.301 --> 19:11.999
The point is, she left a goodbye letter saying she's going to die, Mom!

284
19:15.259 --> 19:17.000
She's going to kill herself.

285
19:18.207 --> 19:20.396
Isn't that what matters the most right now?

286
19:25.519 --> 19:26.764
Then...

287
19:27.813 --> 19:29.484
Where...

288
19:29.484 --> 19:31.504
Where is she right now?

289
19:45.206 --> 19:48.688
I can't overdose, since I can't get my hands on pills.

290
19:48.688 --> 19:52.922
I can't run into traffic, because I'd feel bad for the person who ends up hitting me.

291
19:52.922 --> 19:56.343
Nor am I brave enough to jump.

292
19:56.343 --> 19:58.651
And drowning in the sea here...

293
20:12.973 --> 20:15.463
Drowning in the sea here is...

294
20:28.165 --> 20:30.816
I killed a person...

295
20:32.086 --> 20:35.501
but I'm still scared of dying myself!

296
20:50.104 --> 20:51.751
Hey, you there.

297
20:53.274 --> 20:54.615
Hey, you!

298
21:04.280 --> 21:05.702
Hey, girl.

299
21:05.702 --> 21:07.662
Why are you crying?

300
21:07.662 --> 21:09.158
What's wrong?

301
21:09.791 --> 21:11.332
Is something the matter?

302
21:17.631 --> 21:19.842
What do you mean?

303
21:19.842 --> 21:23.095
Just explain it to me, come on.

304
21:23.095 --> 21:26.936
So he's at the police station right now.

305
21:26.936 --> 21:28.516
The police...

306
21:29.226 --> 21:31.861
went to Yu Gyeom's school.

307
21:31.861 --> 21:34.983
If something happened to him, the school should have handled it.

308
21:34.983 --> 21:37.192
Why did they take him to the police station?

309
21:37.192 --> 21:39.235
That's the thing, Father.

310
21:39.235 --> 21:43.151
The victim reported it to the police herself.

311
21:44.088 --> 21:46.896
So the police have to question the witnesses first.

312
21:48.078 --> 21:49.538
Who was it?

313
21:49.538 --> 21:50.585
Pardon me?

314
21:50.585 --> 21:52.954
Who is this supposed victim?

315
21:52.954 --> 21:55.072
Who the hell is it?

316
22:06.472 --> 22:07.516
Here you go.

317
22:08.515 --> 22:09.755
Drink it.

318
22:09.755 --> 22:11.470
It'll warm you up.

319
22:13.228 --> 22:15.287
By the way, if I may ask...

320
22:15.287 --> 22:17.093
Do you have nowhere to stay?

321
22:19.262 --> 22:20.759
Well?

322
22:20.759 --> 22:22.411
You could stay at my place if you'd like.

323
22:24.865 --> 22:27.201
I'm not a bad person, I promise.

324
22:27.201 --> 22:28.263
Hey.

325
22:28.263 --> 22:31.098
Have you ever seen anyone as pretty as me turn out to be a bad person?

326
22:36.627 --> 22:37.909
I guess you have.

327
22:40.354 --> 22:44.179
By the way, why were you crying back there?

328
22:45.302 --> 22:47.418
Could you tell me in secret?

329
22:49.640 --> 22:50.670
It's okay.

330
22:50.670 --> 22:52.208
You can tell me.

331
23:02.486 --> 23:03.488
I...

332
23:22.342 --> 23:23.537
Sir.

333
23:30.969 --> 23:32.891
I see.

334
23:32.891 --> 23:34.949
So you wanted to die?

335
23:36.687 --> 23:37.731
Yes.

336
23:39.398 --> 23:41.098
Then...

337
23:41.098 --> 23:43.109
Do you want me to help you die?

338
23:44.682 --> 23:46.725
Can you do that for me?

339
23:46.725 --> 23:47.823
Sure!

340
23:47.823 --> 23:49.687
Of course I can do that.

341
23:49.687 --> 23:51.692
You just need to get your hands on some pills.

342
23:51.692 --> 23:54.710
It's the least painful method, right?

343
23:59.585 --> 24:03.234
Places like this... have lots of pills going around.

344
24:06.258 --> 24:08.205
But I'm actually curious.

345
24:08.205 --> 24:10.441
Why do you want to die?

346
24:16.226 --> 24:18.547
Sung Sae Ryeong?

347
24:20.230 --> 24:23.005
Yes, of course I know you.

348
24:27.070 --> 24:31.283
You're the girl Yu Gyeom is seeing, right?

349
24:31.283 --> 24:32.325
Sir.

350
24:32.325 --> 24:35.198
- Yu Gyeom hit me. - Is that so?

351
24:35.198 --> 24:37.173
And you reported it to the police?

352
24:37.173 --> 24:40.274
- Yes, sir, Cho Yu Gyeom-- - Little lass.

353
24:42.127 --> 24:47.144
People are useless when they grow old.

354
24:47.144 --> 24:49.676
But God is fair to all.

355
24:49.676 --> 24:52.973
God bestows a gift upon the old.

356
24:52.973 --> 24:55.334
What could it be, you may ask?

357
24:55.334 --> 24:58.644
An eye, it is, that can see through anything.

358
24:58.644 --> 25:00.827
An eye for discerning things.

359
25:02.078 --> 25:05.853
I hear that your family is quite wealthy.

360
25:05.853 --> 25:08.222
So where are your wealthy parents?

361
25:08.222 --> 25:11.813
Where are they, when their beloved daughter is hurt and lying in a hospital bed?

362
25:11.813 --> 25:15.299
My parents are a bit busy at the moment.

363
25:15.299 --> 25:17.181
Is that so?

364
25:17.913 --> 25:20.765
Your father is a politician, yes?

365
25:21.500 --> 25:24.817
Sung Sae Ryeong, from the Sung family.

366
25:24.817 --> 25:27.186
Of course I know the Sung family.

367
25:27.965 --> 25:29.732
But, if I may recall...

368
25:29.732 --> 25:33.214
no one in the Sung family has ever become a politician.

369
25:35.264 --> 25:37.963
There was, however, a Sung family member who was a sea dog.

370
25:37.963 --> 25:43.077
He'd sail around here in his dinghy, and sometimes he'd come into town.

371
25:43.077 --> 25:45.246
I haven't seen him for some time now.

372
25:47.901 --> 25:50.628
You see, there...

373
25:51.277 --> 25:54.584
There was this deaf and mute woman in the Sung family,

374
25:54.584 --> 25:56.689
that mothered the sea dog.

375
26:01.088 --> 26:03.745
I don't know who that is. That's not my grandma.

376
26:03.745 --> 26:06.838
I didn't say anything about her being your grandmother,

377
26:06.838 --> 26:09.191
I said she was the sea dog's mother.

378
26:17.848 --> 26:21.846
Your incessant lying has stripped you of the ability to discern lies from the truth!

379
26:21.846 --> 26:25.207
- Excuse me. - It's a disease, it is!

380
26:32.946 --> 26:34.447
I murdered someone.

381
26:40.454 --> 26:42.289
Is that so?

382
26:42.289 --> 26:43.739
You?

383
26:44.875 --> 26:46.314
Yes.

384
26:46.314 --> 26:47.988
Right...

385
26:48.879 --> 26:50.368
I see.

386
26:50.368 --> 26:52.443
I get why you'd want to die.

387
26:53.175 --> 26:54.927
Okay.

388
26:54.927 --> 26:59.111
If you're really in that much turmoil, I'll get you some pills.

389
27:03.310 --> 27:05.562
It will cost you a pretty penny, though.

390
27:05.562 --> 27:07.314
Is that okay with you?

391
27:07.314 --> 27:09.942
How much will it be?

392
27:09.942 --> 27:11.693
Well, I don't know.

393
27:11.693 --> 27:15.084
Probably about ten million won.

394
27:23.914 --> 27:25.996
Hey, you, cutie pie.

395
27:25.996 --> 27:29.243
There's a price for everything, even dying.

396
27:34.007 --> 27:36.649
But I don't have that much money.

397
27:36.649 --> 27:37.681
Girl.

398
27:37.681 --> 27:40.034
You're going to die anyway.

399
27:40.034 --> 27:43.030
So all you need to do is call someone and ask to borrow the money.

400
27:43.030 --> 27:45.165
Then you'll be free to die.

401
27:45.165 --> 27:46.581
No need to pay them back.

402
27:46.581 --> 27:48.160
- Okay? - What?

403
27:50.482 --> 27:53.540
But I don't have a phone with me.

404
27:55.112 --> 27:56.780
You're silly.

405
27:56.780 --> 27:59.605
Everybody has a phone these days.

406
27:59.605 --> 28:00.940
You're lying, aren't you?

407
28:01.664 --> 28:03.453
No, I'm telling you the truth.

408
28:03.453 --> 28:06.125
My phone fell into the sea and broke.

409
28:07.332 --> 28:08.810
I see.

410
28:09.668 --> 28:11.038
Well, then.

411
28:12.337 --> 28:13.771
Hey, Hee Ji!

412
28:20.929 --> 28:21.954
There.

413
28:23.094 --> 28:29.828
Take this, step outside, find the payphone nearby, and make that call.

414
28:29.828 --> 28:31.058
You can do that, right?

415
28:31.058 --> 28:35.294
You've made up your mind to die, so how hard can it be to make a call?

416
28:35.294 --> 28:36.322
Right?

417
28:51.209 --> 28:53.475
Sung Sae Ryeong.

418
28:58.698 --> 29:02.441
Did Yu Gyeom really hit you?

419
29:02.441 --> 29:05.244
He can't hit anyone.

420
29:05.244 --> 29:08.353
- No, sir, he definitely-- - I...

421
29:08.353 --> 29:11.146
didn't teach him to do that.

422
29:11.146 --> 29:14.399
I never taught him to do that.

423
29:14.399 --> 29:19.503
My boy, Yu Gyeom, can't do something that I never taught him!

424
29:19.503 --> 29:21.907
You must be delusional, sir,

425
29:21.907 --> 29:25.142
- because Yu Gyeom did actually-- - Hush, now.

426
29:32.501 --> 29:35.170
To ruin his life so utterly and completely,

427
29:35.170 --> 29:38.127
stopping anyone else from swooping in and taking him,

428
29:38.127 --> 29:40.090
so that you can eat him up?

429
29:41.468 --> 29:42.749
Isn't that your plan?

430
29:42.749 --> 29:46.445
- Isn't that your grand scheme, your life goal? - No, it isn't! It's not!

431
29:48.809 --> 29:52.479
You are so young, so supple and pretty.

432
29:52.479 --> 29:55.225
So how did you end up like this?

433
29:55.225 --> 29:56.399
Listen to me, sir--

434
29:56.399 --> 29:59.321
I'm not asking for much.

435
29:59.321 --> 30:02.758
Go to the police, and tell them the truth.

436
30:02.758 --> 30:05.980
The truth, and only the truth.

437
30:05.980 --> 30:10.913
- I'm saying that the truth is that he-- - And you'll get to live here.

438
30:10.913 --> 30:13.877
I'll just pretend nothing happened.

439
30:13.877 --> 30:17.019
But if you keep acting so stubborn...

440
30:17.667 --> 30:21.505
your grand life plan won't ever come to fruition.

441
30:21.505 --> 30:22.863
Why?

442
30:22.863 --> 30:26.192
Because you and your grandmother...

443
30:26.192 --> 30:29.501
will be exiled from this town before any of it can come true.

444
30:30.481 --> 30:31.914
Sir...

445
30:37.737 --> 30:40.479
Do you have anywhere else to go?

446
30:41.653 --> 30:46.730
You're a bright little thing, so I'll take it that you understood me.

447
30:58.828 --> 30:59.978
Let's go.

448
31:14.769 --> 31:16.479
What are you hesitating for?

449
31:16.479 --> 31:18.308
Make the call.

450
31:20.514 --> 31:24.748
[Payphone]

451
31:43.465 --> 31:44.805
Hello?

452
31:45.769 --> 31:48.118
Hey, Jung Yeon.

453
31:48.911 --> 31:50.409
It's me.

454
31:51.806 --> 31:53.710
Do you have money?

455
31:55.602 --> 31:57.260
Money? Why?

456
31:57.260 --> 31:59.383
I just need it.

457
32:02.317 --> 32:03.833
How much?

458
32:03.833 --> 32:06.708
[Payphone] As much as you can scrounge up.

459
32:09.491 --> 32:10.828
Like...

460
32:14.788 --> 32:17.790
about ten million won.

461
32:21.127 --> 32:23.423
All right. I'll do it.

462
32:23.423 --> 32:24.449
What?

463
32:25.131 --> 32:26.593
I'll lend it to you.

464
32:27.884 --> 32:29.700
Wait, seriously?

465
32:29.700 --> 32:31.570
Think it through. You don't have that much money.

466
32:31.570 --> 32:33.211
I do.

467
32:33.211 --> 32:34.307
[Mom, could you track this number?]

468
32:34.307 --> 32:38.336
[Ha Yeon just called me from it.] But, well... It might take an hour or so.

469
32:38.336 --> 32:39.559
Is that okay?

470
32:40.313 --> 32:41.902
An hour?

471
32:41.902 --> 32:43.322
Yes, an hour.

472
32:47.070 --> 32:48.699
Mom, could you track this number?

473
32:48.699 --> 32:50.907
Ha Yeon just called me from it.

474
32:50.907 --> 32:51.938
Sergeant Lee.

475
32:51.938 --> 32:53.113
Yes, sir.

476
32:56.162 --> 32:57.372
Run this number through the system.

477
32:57.372 --> 32:58.605
Yes, sir.

478
33:03.476 --> 33:06.460
I might not need it if it'll take an hour.

479
33:07.747 --> 33:09.050
What?

480
33:09.050 --> 33:10.471
You might not need it?

481
33:10.471 --> 33:12.178
Well...

482
33:12.178 --> 33:13.999
No, I mean, I'll need it.

483
33:13.999 --> 33:15.425
Then give me the account number.

484
33:22.191 --> 33:23.835
Modu Bank...

485
33:25.567 --> 33:27.441
3333...

486
33:27.441 --> 33:29.626
Hey! Hee Ji.

487
33:30.238 --> 33:31.300
Wait a moment.

488
33:31.300 --> 33:32.686
She's making a call.

489
33:35.162 --> 33:37.017
So I should transfer it here?

490
33:40.707 --> 33:41.999
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon.

491
33:44.169 --> 33:47.294
By the way, why are you suddenly so eager to lend me money?

492
33:54.012 --> 33:56.306
You asked me to, no?

493
33:56.306 --> 33:58.128
But are you serious?

494
33:58.128 --> 34:00.309
Think it through. You don't have that much money.

495
34:00.309 --> 34:02.302
Do you want me to, or not?

496
34:04.550 --> 34:06.086
Never mind.

497
34:07.108 --> 34:08.137
I'm hanging up.

498
34:08.137 --> 34:09.401
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon.

499
34:11.777 --> 34:13.525
Where are you right now?

500
34:15.450 --> 34:16.986
Why do you ask?

501
34:16.986 --> 34:18.488
Just... where are you?

502
34:21.000 --> 34:22.921
You're in Seoul, aren't you?

503
34:26.836 --> 34:28.143
Yeah.

504
34:28.143 --> 34:29.319
I am.

505
34:32.162 --> 34:34.513
Is that why you agreed to lend me money?

506
34:34.513 --> 34:35.589
Yes.

507
34:36.369 --> 34:37.591
So?

508
34:40.642 --> 34:42.774
Do you want me to die?

509
34:47.816 --> 34:50.032
I wouldn't say that I want you to.

510
34:51.489 --> 34:53.819
But I don't care enough to stop you.

511
34:54.697 --> 34:57.523
If you don't care, why do you want to know where I am?

512
34:57.523 --> 35:00.592
You're trying to track me down, aren't you?

513
35:00.592 --> 35:01.747
Hey.

514
35:03.208 --> 35:05.524
I'd prefer it if you died, too, okay?

515
35:09.548 --> 35:11.171
What?

516
35:11.171 --> 35:13.587
I said, I'd prefer it if you died, too.

517
35:15.739 --> 35:17.534
Let's be honest.

518
35:17.534 --> 35:20.376
I'm not technically lending you money, am I?

519
35:20.376 --> 35:23.288
I'm just donating all my money to let you die.

520
35:23.939 --> 35:27.317
Don't you think I deserve to know where you are, at least?

521
35:31.067 --> 35:32.296
Damn it!

522
35:32.296 --> 35:36.738
I need to know where you are so that I can collect your corpse!

523
35:37.496 --> 35:39.047
Where the hell are you?

524
35:44.009 --> 35:45.009
I'm...

525
35:47.171 --> 35:49.162
I am at...

526
35:51.796 --> 35:53.851
A payphone near Gorae Port.

527
35:53.851 --> 35:56.854
We just informed the nearby precinct.

528
35:56.854 --> 36:00.123
We'll also track the bank account, so we'll find her soon enough.

529
36:01.570 --> 36:02.946
Thank you, sir.

530
36:03.704 --> 36:06.568
And your son is in Seoul right now, is that correct?

531
36:07.349 --> 36:09.171
Yes, sir, he's...

532
36:09.171 --> 36:10.347
He's in Seoul.

533
36:10.347 --> 36:14.621
Well, judging by the fact that your daughter is asking for money out of nowhere...

534
36:16.596 --> 36:20.644
You see, there's a big human trafficking ring right around that area.

535
36:21.367 --> 36:24.210
We suspect that she may have come into contact with one of them.

536
36:24.210 --> 36:26.993
Of course, it's too soon to say for sure.

537
36:27.874 --> 36:31.050
But you should warn your son to stay away at all costs.

538
36:31.050 --> 36:33.846
It may be dangerous for him if he goes there, too.

539
36:33.846 --> 36:36.331
He's pretty young as well, isn't he?

540
36:38.259 --> 36:39.741
He is.

541
36:48.853 --> 36:51.388
You're heading to Gorae Port, yes?

542
36:51.388 --> 36:52.526
I am.

543
36:52.526 --> 36:53.962
By the way, sir?

544
36:53.962 --> 36:56.191
I'm in a hurry. Could you get me there quickly?

545
36:56.191 --> 36:58.093
Yeah, sure thing.

546
37:00.124 --> 37:01.511
So.

547
37:01.511 --> 37:04.568
When is your brother going to transfer the money?

548
37:05.898 --> 37:07.976
He said in an hour or so.

549
37:09.916 --> 37:12.247
Why would it take so long?

550
37:12.247 --> 37:14.504
He just needs to transfer the money from his account.

551
37:14.504 --> 37:16.653
It shouldn't take more than two seconds.

552
37:16.653 --> 37:18.341
I overheard them talking.

553
37:18.341 --> 37:19.801
What was it you said?

554
37:19.801 --> 37:22.177
The money is scattered across multiple accounts, or something?

555
37:22.177 --> 37:23.674
Yes.

556
37:23.674 --> 37:26.519
He said he needs to go to the bank himself.

557
37:27.892 --> 37:29.401
Is that so?

558
37:30.270 --> 37:32.282
Well, then, Ha Yeong.

559
37:32.282 --> 37:34.592
Excuse me, I...

560
37:34.592 --> 37:37.485
I'm Ha Yeon.

561
37:37.485 --> 37:39.338
Yeah, sure.

562
37:39.338 --> 37:41.012
Ha Yeon.

563
37:42.471 --> 37:44.656
Can you take your clothes off?

564
37:53.667 --> 37:55.125
What?

565
37:55.125 --> 37:58.006
As you can see here...

566
37:58.006 --> 38:03.099
Sung Sae Ryeong and Kim Ha Yeon walk this way,

567
38:03.099 --> 38:05.529
and the time is around 9:24 p.m.

568
38:05.529 --> 38:06.931
Yes.

569
38:06.931 --> 38:08.516
And this here...

570
38:08.516 --> 38:11.417
is the footage of Cho Yu Gyeom heading toward the lighthouse.

571
38:11.417 --> 38:15.898
As you can see, the time is 9:24 p.m.

572
38:15.898 --> 38:16.954
And?

573
38:16.954 --> 38:18.908
Well, so...

574
38:18.908 --> 38:23.203
That would mean that, at the same time, Sung Sae Ryeong and Kim Ha Yeon went this way,

575
38:23.203 --> 38:26.174
and Cho Yu Gyeom went that way.

576
38:26.784 --> 38:28.620
I'm sure you already know,

577
38:28.620 --> 38:32.779
but there's some distance between the rice fields here and the lighthouse there.

578
38:32.779 --> 38:36.043
It would still take more than half an hour to travel, even on a bike.

579
38:36.043 --> 38:37.541
What I'm saying is,

580
38:37.541 --> 38:43.221
what Sung Sae Ryeong is claiming is highly improbable, to say the least.

581
38:44.016 --> 38:47.600
So can I take Yu Gyeom home now?

582
38:47.600 --> 38:51.383
- Yes, of course. We're sorry for the hassle. - No worries, sir.

583
38:51.383 --> 38:54.099
- We should thank you for your service. - No, it's fine.

584
38:54.099 --> 38:56.628
- Yu Gyeom! - What about Kim Ha Yeon?

585
38:57.357 --> 39:00.013
- Pardon? - So where's Kim Ha Yeon?

586
39:00.013 --> 39:02.584
You said she's gone missing, didn't you?

587
39:02.584 --> 39:03.655
Did you find her?

588
39:03.655 --> 39:07.086
Well, we're still working on it.

589
39:07.086 --> 39:08.672
Sergeant Choi, a moment, please.

590
39:08.672 --> 39:10.041
Excuse me.

591
39:11.329 --> 39:14.082
We have a location for Kim Ha Yeon, sir.

592
39:14.082 --> 39:15.820
She's near Gorae Port.

593
39:15.820 --> 39:17.532
Or so it seems.

594
39:19.337 --> 39:22.477
She seems to be held hostage by that trafficking ring.

595
39:22.477 --> 39:25.385
So maybe we should reach out first, and...

596
39:25.385 --> 39:27.294
Hey, Yu Gyeom!

597
39:27.294 --> 39:28.860
Yu Gyeom!

598
39:29.654 --> 39:30.894
Well, Ha Yeon?

599
39:31.802 --> 39:33.403
I'm asking you a question.

600
39:33.403 --> 39:35.535
Can you take your clothes off, or not?

601
39:41.567 --> 39:43.713
W-Why do you ask?

602
39:43.713 --> 39:45.837
Oh, come on!

603
39:45.837 --> 39:49.412
Your brother hasn't transferred the money yet.

604
39:50.915 --> 39:54.578
But it hasn't been an hour yet, and...

605
39:55.447 --> 39:58.336
You know what, I don't want the pills anymore.

606
40:00.753 --> 40:04.340
It's too late now, Ha Yeon.

607
40:04.340 --> 40:10.225
The moment you said you wanted those pills, we already got the pills.

608
40:10.225 --> 40:14.225
It cost us a fortune to get them.

609
40:14.225 --> 40:17.756
But how much have you paid us so far?

610
40:17.756 --> 40:19.294
Twenty...

611
40:19.294 --> 40:20.631
Thirty...

612
40:23.003 --> 40:25.018
What is this?

613
40:26.612 --> 40:29.114
I told you they're worth ten million won!

614
40:29.114 --> 40:31.331
But you gave me 236,000 won, and that's it?

615
40:31.331 --> 40:34.203
This won't do, don't you think?

616
40:34.203 --> 40:35.516
I see that, yeah.

617
40:35.516 --> 40:38.440
So you can just have that, and I'll just...

618
40:40.918 --> 40:42.745
In here...

619
40:42.745 --> 40:46.753
You can't take your words back once you let them out.

620
40:48.891 --> 40:51.411
Just pay us for the pills.

621
40:51.411 --> 40:54.265
We don't give a damn if you actually take them or not.

622
40:54.265 --> 40:57.455
But! We already secured the pills.

623
40:57.455 --> 40:59.561
So you'll have to pay for them.

624
40:59.561 --> 41:00.909
Do you follow?

625
41:00.909 --> 41:03.483
But you're a little short on money.

626
41:03.483 --> 41:06.986
That's why I'm asking you to undress.

627
41:06.986 --> 41:09.287
Is it so hard to do?

628
41:09.287 --> 41:11.264
All you need to do is raise your arms,

629
41:11.264 --> 41:14.225
- and roll your clothes up. - No!

630
41:15.382 --> 41:18.370
I really don't feel comfortable getting undressed.

631
41:21.417 --> 41:22.877
Ha Yeon.

632
41:22.877 --> 41:24.837
I'm a woman.

633
41:24.837 --> 41:28.424
Girls go to public baths together all the time.

634
41:28.424 --> 41:30.521
Just think of it as that.

635
41:30.521 --> 41:34.809
Take off your clothes for a little while, and you can put them back on.

636
41:36.307 --> 41:37.829
I'll give you the money.

637
41:37.829 --> 41:42.432
You can have it when my brother transfers it, but please, I can't take my clothes off.

638
41:42.432 --> 41:43.505
Hey.

639
41:45.277 --> 41:48.029
Are you sure you can get me 10 million won?

640
41:48.882 --> 41:52.420
Exactly 10 million, and not a coin less?

641
41:54.075 --> 41:57.599
My brother said he'd send about 8 million won.

642
41:57.599 --> 41:59.621
So what about the other 2 million?

643
42:01.515 --> 42:03.075
But the...

644
42:03.075 --> 42:05.397
The 236,000 won that I gave you...

645
42:05.397 --> 42:10.560
All right, then what about the other 1,764,000 won?

646
42:15.429 --> 42:20.867
I'm asking because I can give you a discount, if only you would take your clothes off!

647
42:22.687 --> 42:24.878
I really don't want to...

648
42:33.865 --> 42:35.588
Well, then.

649
42:41.122 --> 42:43.182
I'll give you 10 minutes.

650
42:43.182 --> 42:46.335
If you're still fully clothed after the 10 minutes pass,

651
42:46.335 --> 42:49.041
I'll get them off if I have to beat them off of you.

652
42:49.041 --> 42:50.395
Got it?

653
42:52.174 --> 42:53.219
Hey.

654
42:53.219 --> 42:57.245
Ha Yeong, I mean, Ha Yeon, wants 10 minutes.

655
43:25.195 --> 43:26.431
Get inside.

656
43:28.255 --> 43:29.514
Hey.

657
43:29.514 --> 43:32.136
It's past four o'clock now, you hear me?

658
43:32.802 --> 43:36.180
But your brother still hasn't transferred the money.

659
43:36.930 --> 43:41.678
And on top of that, you made such a fuss that we couldn't even undress you!

660
43:44.313 --> 43:47.031
You're giving us such a hard time.

661
43:48.475 --> 43:49.620
Miss?

662
43:49.620 --> 43:52.860
- I can go home and ask my mom to-- - Enough.

663
43:52.860 --> 43:54.779
You wait right here.

664
43:54.779 --> 43:58.888
I'll let you out once your brother pays us. Got it?

665
43:58.888 --> 44:00.826
- What? - What's wrong?

666
44:01.788 --> 44:04.427
Want to find out what a true beating is like?

667
44:06.209 --> 44:08.294
Get in there. Now!

668
44:10.434 --> 44:11.893
No!

669
44:15.177 --> 44:16.435
Miss?

670
44:16.435 --> 44:18.648
Miss!

671
44:18.648 --> 44:20.340
Is anybody there?

672
44:20.340 --> 44:22.011
Miss!

673
44:50.587 --> 44:51.893
Mom!

674
44:52.562 --> 44:54.075
Why aren't the police coming?

675
44:54.075 --> 44:56.026
It's been over two hours since I called the police,

676
44:56.026 --> 44:57.804
so why isn't anybody here?

677
44:57.804 --> 44:59.172
J-Jung Yeon!

678
44:59.172 --> 45:01.010
Why aren't they coming?

679
45:02.582 --> 45:04.606
You... Are you...

680
45:04.606 --> 45:06.121
Did you go where Ha Yeon is?

681
45:06.121 --> 45:07.516
Oh, no, no!

682
45:07.516 --> 45:09.852
The policeman said that you shouldn't go there!

683
45:09.852 --> 45:13.635
- Jung Yeon! - It's just that I can't find her anywhere.

684
45:13.635 --> 45:16.318
I went to the address she gave me, but no one was there.

685
45:16.318 --> 45:20.469
Why would you go there? That's the police's job!

686
45:20.469 --> 45:22.523
Get out of there right now!

687
45:22.523 --> 45:24.291
Do you want to see me lose it?

688
45:24.291 --> 45:26.392
- Is that it? - Seriously, Mom!

689
45:27.747 --> 45:29.540
Mom.

690
45:29.540 --> 45:33.562
Do you know what human trafficking is, Mom?

691
45:33.562 --> 45:34.759
Do you?

692
45:36.797 --> 45:39.169
Please, Jung Yeon...

693
45:39.169 --> 45:41.915
Please just get out of there.

694
45:41.915 --> 45:43.983
I'm begging you, please!

695
45:45.208 --> 45:47.757
Do you seriously not care about Ha Yeon at all?

696
45:49.274 --> 45:51.427
So what if I leave now?

697
45:52.342 --> 45:54.162
Who will look for her then?

698
45:54.857 --> 45:56.692
The police aren't here.

699
45:56.692 --> 45:59.128
There's literally nobody here!

700
45:59.128 --> 46:01.437
So tell me, who's going to find her?

701
46:02.155 --> 46:05.039
Mom, listen, Mom...

702
46:05.039 --> 46:07.900
She could be dead, or being sold off!

703
46:09.162 --> 46:11.627
Are you aware of the situation?

704
46:22.535 --> 46:24.415
Mommy can't...

705
46:25.042 --> 46:27.940
I can't do anything...

706
46:27.940 --> 46:30.955
There's nothing that I can do!

707
46:30.955 --> 46:33.234
Damn it!

708
46:36.142 --> 46:37.723
Ha Yeon!

709
46:50.114 --> 46:52.116
Get me to Gorae Port, please.

710
46:55.749 --> 46:58.191
Yeah, I remember, too.

711
46:58.191 --> 46:59.793
Thank goodness, right?

712
46:59.793 --> 47:03.271
Good afternoon. We're here following up on a report.

713
47:06.671 --> 47:07.912
What do you mean?

714
47:07.912 --> 47:10.227
A girl came here, didn't she?

715
47:10.227 --> 47:11.506
Where is she?

716
47:12.810 --> 47:14.645
Hey, mister.

717
47:14.645 --> 47:17.520
A girl coming into a coffee shop is hardly illegal.

718
47:17.520 --> 47:18.671
Mister.

719
47:18.671 --> 47:20.359
We're a proper establishment.

720
47:20.359 --> 47:23.824
The girl in question has been reported missing.

721
47:23.824 --> 47:26.496
We're looking for her right now.

722
47:27.869 --> 47:31.808
So you expect us to interrogate every teenager who comes here

723
47:31.808 --> 47:34.743
and find out if they were reported missing or not?

724
47:34.743 --> 47:36.694
Is that what you want?

725
47:40.098 --> 47:42.930
We're already having a hard time running this place. You don't need to annoy us.

726
47:42.930 --> 47:44.341
Ma'am.

727
47:44.341 --> 47:47.345
We already know what's going on here.

728
47:47.345 --> 47:50.009
This is a human trafficking ring!

729
47:55.272 --> 47:56.772
Enough games.

730
47:56.772 --> 47:58.508
Where is she?

731
47:58.508 --> 48:01.778
Confess, and we'll give you leniency on your sentence.

732
48:01.778 --> 48:03.913
Look at you, big guy, with your big words.

733
48:03.913 --> 48:06.493
Mister, do you have proof?

734
48:06.493 --> 48:08.903
Do you see any proof lying around?

735
48:08.903 --> 48:10.599
Is being a detective such a big deal?

736
48:10.599 --> 48:13.125
Yes, in fact, it is a big deal.

737
48:18.880 --> 48:20.915
Hey, there's a tunnel here. Let's go.

738
48:20.915 --> 48:23.071
Get him!

739
48:23.071 --> 48:24.675
- Check it out. - Yes, sir.

740
48:26.470 --> 48:29.511
It's not what you think!

741
48:29.511 --> 48:30.940
Hey.

742
48:30.940 --> 48:32.408
Hey!

743
48:34.865 --> 48:36.644
You brutes are crossing the line!

744
48:36.644 --> 48:39.052
Dropped the polite act, have you?

745
48:39.052 --> 48:40.828
She's not here, damn it.

746
48:40.828 --> 48:42.605
I said she's not goddamn here!

747
48:42.605 --> 48:45.152
In my thirteen years of being a detective,

748
48:45.152 --> 48:48.252
I've never had a case where those words were actually true.

749
48:48.252 --> 48:50.044
Kim Ha Yeon!

750
48:50.711 --> 48:52.430
Where are you?

751
48:54.544 --> 48:55.582
Hey.

752
48:55.582 --> 48:57.338
We're in trouble. Get here fast.

753
49:04.798 --> 49:07.177
Miss, my brother said he sent the money!

754
49:07.177 --> 49:08.717
Miss!

755
49:12.379 --> 49:13.938
Hi, little Missy.

756
49:20.274 --> 49:21.619
Who are you?

757
49:21.619 --> 49:24.275
Where's the lady? My brother says he sent the money.

758
49:24.275 --> 49:25.905
Hey, you.

759
49:25.905 --> 49:27.531
I thought you didn't have your phone.

760
49:27.531 --> 49:30.067
How do you know if he sent the money or not?

761
49:33.537 --> 49:34.749
I mean...

762
49:46.008 --> 49:47.284
Ha Yeon!

763
49:48.178 --> 49:49.487
Kim Ha Yeon!

764
50:00.559 --> 50:02.209
Ha Yeon!

765
50:06.306 --> 50:07.433
Missy.

766
50:08.238 --> 50:09.865
Did you call the police?

767
50:09.865 --> 50:13.222
No, how would I do that? I genuinely don't have a phone, and...

768
50:13.222 --> 50:17.031
You used a payphone, right? Did you call the police with it?

769
50:17.031 --> 50:18.607
No, I swear I didn't!

770
50:18.607 --> 50:20.271
Hey!

771
50:20.271 --> 50:23.039
You really messed things up for us, you know!

772
50:23.039 --> 50:27.591
If you want to die, just do it! Why would you call the police?

773
50:27.591 --> 50:29.186
Come here, you.

774
50:30.052 --> 50:31.956
Grab her, come on!

775
50:33.132 --> 50:36.611
- But I swear I didn't call the police! - Come here!

776
50:47.171 --> 50:48.328
Ha Yeon!

777
50:48.328 --> 50:49.864
What? What's wrong?

778
50:50.925 --> 50:52.616
Run!

779
50:52.616 --> 50:54.012
You bastard!

780
50:55.115 --> 50:57.051
Move, you bastard!

781
50:57.051 --> 50:58.613
Go, run!

782
51:02.376 --> 51:03.403
Go!

783
51:03.403 --> 51:05.212
- Go! - Grab her!

784
51:05.212 --> 51:06.657
Run!

785
51:10.884 --> 51:12.383
Wait, wait.

786
51:12.383 --> 51:13.425
I'm a policeman.

787
51:13.425 --> 51:15.698
We're the police, yes.

788
51:15.698 --> 51:17.667
- Are you okay? - H-help me.

789
51:17.667 --> 51:19.518
Help me, sir, please!

790
51:19.518 --> 51:21.019
Help me...

791
51:21.019 --> 51:22.835
I'm here, please! I'm locked in here!

792
51:22.835 --> 51:24.257
Help me, I'm here! Mister!

793
51:24.257 --> 51:26.397
You, ask for backup.

794
51:26.397 --> 51:28.331
Things just got serious.

795
51:28.331 --> 51:30.264
- Wait just a little longer. - Okay.

796
51:38.138 --> 51:39.715
Captain, sir!

797
52:18.532 --> 52:19.719
Answer me. Say it.

798
52:19.719 --> 52:21.747
I said, answer me!

799
52:21.747 --> 52:23.239
Come here.

800
52:23.915 --> 52:25.036
Hey, scumbag!

801
52:25.036 --> 52:27.457
- Police! - Get him!

802
52:27.457 --> 52:28.678
Stop there!

803
52:28.678 --> 52:30.615
- This is the police! - Hey, are you okay?

804
52:30.615 --> 52:31.707
Sir!

805
52:31.707 --> 52:33.010
Hey!

806
52:33.010 --> 52:37.297
[Ambulance]

807
52:38.764 --> 52:40.919
You can't do this!

808
52:42.238 --> 52:44.744
- It hurts! - You scumbag!

809
52:52.211 --> 52:53.886
Stay still!

810
52:57.198 --> 52:58.878
I didn't!

811
53:00.088 --> 53:01.116
Detective, sir!

812
53:01.116 --> 53:02.178
Where's Ha Yeon?

813
53:02.178 --> 53:03.987
We haven't found her yet.

814
53:03.987 --> 53:05.394
I'm sorry.

815
53:22.225 --> 53:23.626
That day...

816
53:24.725 --> 53:28.257
The morning battered my face with droplets of rain,

817
53:29.838 --> 53:31.825
and that sea...

818
53:31.825 --> 53:34.191
Its briny smell carried more salt than ever.

819
53:57.012 --> 54:00.050
Past the scent of men I cannot name,

820
54:01.093 --> 54:05.117
and the stench of the sewers filling the alleyway,

821
54:06.473 --> 54:11.810
I am greeted by the sky, blue as ever, and the wailing cicadas.

822
54:27.286 --> 54:30.145
When I turned to look behind me,

823
54:30.145 --> 54:34.833
I was standing in a different world, a world unlike mine.

824
54:44.859 --> 54:46.028
Ha Yeon.

825
55:26.779 --> 55:29.109
I told you I'd wait at the lighthouse.

826
55:31.085 --> 55:32.476
And...

827
55:33.325 --> 55:36.241
of all the summers that I would meet,

828
55:37.104 --> 55:39.924
the sole, most unforgettable summer,

829
55:39.924 --> 55:42.169
the one and only summer...

830
55:44.940 --> 55:46.407
was starting,

831
55:48.158 --> 55:50.853
for us.
